            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.62</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Safer job cancelling.</b> A job is only marked as cancelled when the provider confirms it. Jobs without a confirmed provider ID keep their real status.</li>
<li><b>Agent groundwork.</b> The creative agent gains a new event log and safety layer that runs silently alongside the current behavior.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
