            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.61</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Remove and Expand work on large images.</b> Very large photos hit the provider's 10 MB upload limit and failed. Sources are now transferred in a compact format; the final result is still assembled from your original pixels at full quality.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
